[statement]
A package with a condition, reached as a dependency, leads the walk through
its dependencies only, not its condition: `b-extra` places `y` before it,
and `b`, its condition, after.

[repository]
P:a
V:1
D:b-extra

P:b-extra
V:1
i:b
D:y

P:b
V:1

P:y
V:1

P:z
V:1
D:b

[request]
a
z

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install y 1
install b-extra 1
install a 1
install b 1
install z 1
